        <body>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela e çmimeve</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_plan" approved="yes"><source>Plan</source><target>Plani</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_price" approved="yes"><source>Price</source><target>Çmimi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_group" approved="yes"><source>Feature group</source><target>Grupi i veçorive</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Veçori</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vlera</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela e çmimeve</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table.description" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards, comparison table or compact rows from one pricing table record.</source><target>Kartat e planeve, tabela krahasuese ose rreshtat kompakt nga një regjistër i tabelës së çmimeve.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.general" approved="yes"><source>General</source><target>Të përgjithshme</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Veçoritë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Çmimet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Theksim</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titulli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Shënim hyrës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Shfaqet mbi çmimet në çdo paraqitje, p.sh. „Të gjitha çmimet në muaj, plus TVSH.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Shumat e futura janë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Përcakton se si lexohen shumat e futura. Konvertimi kryhet vetëm nga neto në bruto, asnjëherë anasjelltas.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Çmime neto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Çmime bruto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Norma tatimore në përqindje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Baza për shfaqjen bruto. 0 e anashkalon konvertimin.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Vizitorët mund të kalojnë ndërmjet neto dhe bruto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Nëse nuk zgjidhet, faqja shfaq vetëm opsionin e zgjedhur më sipër.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Monedha e ndërrueshme</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Ndërruesi shfaqet vetëm nëse për planet është futur më shumë se një monedhë.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Periudha e faturimit e ndërrueshme</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Ndërruesi shfaqet vetëm nëse për planet është futur më shumë se një periudhë.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Simboli i monedhës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Anglishtja zakonisht e vendos para shumës („€ 99“), gjermanishtja dhe shumica e gjuhëve kontinentale evropiane pas saj („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>para shumës (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>pas shumës (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Etiketa e butonit</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Zbatohet për të gjitha planet pa etiketë të tyre. Bosh do të thotë „Zgjidh“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Zgjidh</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Grupet e veçorive</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Veçoritë i përkasin tabelës, jo një plani të vetëm — kjo është mënyra e vetme që tabela krahasuese të krahasojë të njëjtat gjëra.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Emri</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Nëntitulli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>Një rresht poshtë emrit, p.sh. „6 njoftime pune për 30 ditë secili“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Mbi titull</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Linjë e vogël mbi emrin, p.sh. „48 burime të përfshira“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Përshkrimi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Theksim</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Plani merr një kufi dhe hije në ngjyrën e theksit, dhe një kolonë të ngjyrosur në tabelën krahasuese.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Teksti i emblemës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Bosh e lë emblemën jashtë. Të zakonshme janë „Popullor“ ose „I rekomanduar“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Popullor</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Synimi i butonit Zgjidh</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Pa lidhje nuk paraqitet asnjë buton — as bosh, as vendmbajtës.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Etiketa vetjake</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Zëvendëson etiketën nga tabela e çmimeve, vetëm për këtë plan.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Shënim poshtë çmimit</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>P.sh. „faturim vjetor“ ose „pa TVSH“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Çmimet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Vlerat e veçorive</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Veçoritë pa vlerë konsiderohen si të papërfshira dhe shfaqin një vizë. Jo çdo qelizë duhet të plotësohet.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Monedha</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Periudha</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.month" approved="yes"><source>per month</source><target>në muaj</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.year" approved="yes"><source>per year</source><target>në vit</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.once" approved="yes"><source>one-time</source><target>një herë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.custom" approved="yes"><source>custom</source><target>tjetër</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own unit</source><target>Njësia vetjake</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “per ad” or “per calendar”.</source><target>P.sh. „për njoftim“ ose „për kalendar“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.amount" approved="yes"><source>Amount</source><target>Shuma</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequest" approved="yes"><source>Price on request</source><target>Çmim sipas kërkesës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel" approved="yes"><source>Text instead of the amount</source><target>Tekst në vend të shumës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Bosh do të thotë „Çmim sipas kërkesës“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titulli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Paraqitja</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>Një listë kontrolli për veçori po/jo, çifte vlerash për detaje si tarifat ose kuotat.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Listë kontrolli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Çifte vlerash</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Shfaq në karta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Disa grupe i përkasin vetëm tabelës krahasuese dhe do ta mbingarkonin kartën.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Shfaq në tabelën krahasuese</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Nëse nuk zgjidhet, grupi lihet jashtë tabelës krahasuese.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Veçoritë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titulli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Lloji i vlerës</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Përcakton se si duket qeliza në tabelën krahasuese.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Shenjë ose vizë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Numër</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Tekst</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Përqindje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Njësia</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Shfaqet pas vlerës, p.sh. „GB“ ose „përdorues“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Shënim në fund</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Shfaqet me shkrim të vogël pas titullit në tabelën krahasuese.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Veçori</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Përfshirë</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Zbatohet për veçoritë e llojit „Shenjë ose vizë“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vlera</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Për numër, tekst dhe përqindje. P.sh. „pa kufi“, „deri në 48“ ose „2.1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela e çmimeve</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela e çmimeve</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Regjistrimi që mban planet dhe veçoritë. E njëjta tabelë mund të shfaqet në disa faqe me paraqitje të ndryshme.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Paraqitja</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Kartat e planeve për pak plane, rreshtat kompakt nga rreth pesë, tabela krahasuese për shumë veçori.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Kartat e planeve</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Tabela krahasuese</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Karta me grupe veçorish</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Rreshtat kompakt</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Karta me detaje të zgjerueshme</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Shfaq edhe tabelën krahasuese</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Tabela krahasuese më pas shfaqet poshtë paraqitjes së zgjedhur.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Tabela krahasuese e mbyllur</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Tabela krahasuese hapet vetëm me klikim — e mban faqen të qetë me shumë veçori.</target></trans-unit>
        </body>
